{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15453","headline":"题云际寺准上人房 · 李端","name":"题云际寺准上人房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高僧居处似天台，锡杖铜瓶对绿苔。\n竹巷雨晴春鸟啭，山房日午老人来。\n园中鹿过椒枝动，潭底龙游水沫开。\n独夜焚香礼遗像，空林月出始应回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}